/* TripMate 吃喝探索 —— 风格与首页一致：背景 #FAF9F6、白卡圆角 32rpx、主题色 #7C9C7E */
.page {
  min-height: 100vh;
  background: #FAF9F6;
  padding: 32rpx 32rpx 60rpx;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

/* 顶部标题：30rpx 加粗 #333 */
.header {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  margin-bottom: 28rpx;
}
.header-top {
  display: flex;
  align-items: baseline;
  justify-content: space-between;
}
.title {
  font-size: 30rpx;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #333;
}
.stats {
  font-size: 24rpx;
  color: #7C9C7E;
}
.subtitle {
  font-size: 26rpx;
  color: #999;
  margin-top: 8rpx;
}

/* 功能 1：今天吃啥抽签卡（主题色 12% 透明度底） */
.pick-card {
  background: rgba(124, 156, 126, 0.12);
  border-radius: 32rpx;
  padding: 30rpx;
  margin-bottom: 28rpx;
}
.pick-head {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}
.pick-title {
  font-size: 30rpx;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #333;
}
.pick-sub {
  font-size: 24rpx;
  color: #888;
  margin-top: 6rpx;
}
.pick-result {
  background: #fff;
  border-radius: 20rpx;
  padding: 24rpx;
  margin: 20rpx 0;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}
.pick-name {
  font-size: 30rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: #7C9C7E;
}
.pick-meta {
  font-size: 24rpx;
  color: #999;
  margin-top: 8rpx;
}
.pick-empty {
  background: #fff;
  border-radius: 20rpx;
  padding: 24rpx;
  margin: 20rpx 0;
  font-size: 24rpx;
  color: #aaa;
}
.pick-actions {
  display: flex;
  gap: 16rpx;
}
.pick-btn {
  flex: 1;
  border-radius: 16rpx;
  font-size: 26rpx;
  font-weight: 500;
}
.pick-btn.main {
  background: #7C9C7E;
  color: #fff;
}
.pick-btn.ghost {
  background: #fff;
  color: #7C9C7E;
  border: 2rpx solid #7C9C7E;
}
.pick-btn.main::after,
.pick-btn.ghost::after {
  border: none;
}
.pick-btn[disabled] {
  opacity: 0.5;
  color: #7C9C7E;
  background: #fff;
}

/* 功能 2：类型筛选 chips */
.chips {
  white-space: nowrap;
  margin-bottom: 24rpx;
}
.chip {
  display: inline-block;
  background: #fff;
  color: #666;
  font-size: 24rpx;
  border-radius: 999rpx;
  padding: 10rpx 28rpx;
  margin-right: 12rpx;
  border: 2rpx solid #ececec;
}
.chip-on {
  background: #7C9C7E;
  color: #fff;
  border-color: #7C9C7E;
}

/* 店铺列表：白底卡片、圆角 32rpx、柔和阴影 */
.shop-list {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 20rpx;
  margin-bottom: 32rpx;
}
.empty {
  background: #fff;
  border-radius: 32rpx;
  padding: 60rpx 30rpx;
  text-align: center;
  color: #aaa;
  font-size: 26rpx;
  box-shadow: 0 4rpx 16rpx rgba(51, 51, 51, 0.04);
}
.shop-card {
  background: #fff;
  border-radius: 32rpx;
  padding: 30rpx;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  box-shadow: 0 4rpx 16rpx rgba(51, 51, 51, 0.04);
}
.shop-card.visited {
  opacity: 0.6;
}
.shop-main {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  flex: 1;
  margin-right: 20rpx;
}
.shop-top {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 16rpx;
}
.shop-name {
  font-size: 28rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: #333;
}
.shop-card.visited .shop-name {
  text-decoration: line-through;
  color: #bbb;
}
/* 类型标签：主题色 12% 透明度底色 */
.shop-type {
  font-size: 22rpx;
  color: #7C9C7E;
  background: rgba(124, 156, 126, 0.12);
  border-radius: 10rpx;
  padding: 4rpx 14rpx;
}
.shop-address {
  font-size: 26rpx;
  color: #888;
  margin-top: 10rpx;
}
.visited-badge {
  margin-top: 12rpx;
  align-self: flex-start;
  font-size: 22rpx;
  color: #7C9C7E;
  background: rgba(124, 156, 126, 0.12);
  border-radius: 10rpx;
  padding: 4rpx 14rpx;
}

/* 去过按钮：主题色描边，标记后变灰 */
.visited-btn {
  background: #fff;
  color: #7C9C7E;
  border: 2rpx solid #7C9C7E;
  border-radius: 30rpx;
  font-size: 24rpx;
  padding: 0 28rpx;
  line-height: 2.2;
}
.visited-btn.on {
  background: #f2f2f2;
  color: #999;
  border-color: #e0e0e0;
}

/* 添加表单 */
.form {
  background: #fff;
  border-radius: 32rpx;
  padding: 32rpx 30rpx;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 20rpx;
  box-shadow: 0 4rpx 16rpx rgba(51, 51, 51, 0.04);
  margin-bottom: 32rpx;
}
.form-title {
  font-size: 30rpx;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #333;
}
.input {
  background: #FAF9F6;
  border-radius: 20rpx;
  padding: 22rpx 26rpx;
  font-size: 28rpx;
  color: #333;
}
.picker {
  background: #FAF9F6;
  border-radius: 20rpx;
  padding: 22rpx 26rpx;
  font-size: 28rpx;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
}
.picker-label {
  color: #999;
  font-size: 26rpx;
}
.picker-value {
  color: #333;
}
/* 主按钮：主题色 #7C9C7E */
.add-btn {
  background: #7C9C7E;
  color: #fff;
  border-radius: 20rpx;
  font-size: 28rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
}
.add-btn::after {
  border: none;
}

/* 功能 3：灵感发现（虚线卡片 = 还不是我的店） */
.ideas-title {
  font-size: 30rpx;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #333;
  margin-bottom: 20rpx;
}
.ideas-sub {
  font-size: 22rpx;
  color: #999;
  font-weight: 400;
  margin-left: 12rpx;
}
.idea-card {
  background: #fff;
  border: 2rpx dashed #d8d8d8;
  border-radius: 32rpx;
  padding: 28rpx 30rpx;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  margin-bottom: 20rpx;
}
.idea-main {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  flex: 1;
  margin-right: 20rpx;
}
.idea-meta {
  font-size: 24rpx;
  color: #999;
  margin-top: 10rpx;
}
.idea-add {
  background: #7C9C7E;
  color: #fff;
  border-radius: 999rpx;
  font-size: 24rpx;
  padding: 0 28rpx;
}
.idea-add::after {
  border: none;
}

